Description: Cin-MinAI look: wallpapers, boot splash and theme defaults
 Identifies this system as Cin-MinAI, based on Linux Mint: the wallpapers (data-stream
 is the default), the boot splash, and Mint's own dark theme with the Aqua accent as
 defaults. Adds files and defaults only; nothing of Mint's is replaced.
